# Compiled golden-model binary and its generated vector files (model/golden.c
# writes these at run time; see docs/planning/tasks/002-golden-model.md).
model/golden
model/golden.exe
model/vectors/

# Cadence Xcelium (xrun) output -- scripts/run_xrun.sh writes everything
# under xrun_out/; the rest is what a bare xrun drops in the working dir.
xrun_out/
xcelium.d/
INCA_libs/
xrun.history
xrun.key
xrun.log
xmsim.key
*.shm/
.simvision/
*.log

# Synopsys Design Compiler output (syn/dc_run.tcl writes everything under
# syn/out/<design>/: logs, reports, netlist, .ddc, WORK/, default.svf).
syn/out/

# Synopsys DC scratch files. constraints/pm_dc_script_unpu.tcl cd's into syn/out/work/<profile>/ (already ignored
# above), so these should no longer appear in the repo root; the patterns cover the leftovers of runs made before task 055.
UNPU_*.mr
unpu_*-verilog.pvl
unpu_*-verilog.syn
default.svf
alib-*/

# ICC2 outputs of the pnr_v2 flow (written next to the clone on the server)
pnr_icc2/

# ---- Final/ (task 099) ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Final/ is the project record and IS in git (the repository is PUBLIC). Databases, NDM libraries, kit files, rule decks, checkpoint
# exports and the raw server copy are NOT inside Final/ (listed with name, size, sha256 in Final/INDEX.md, section "Not in Final").
# The rules above ignore *.log and other tool leftovers everywhere; inside Final/ the logs and reports are the point.
!Final/**/*.log
!Final/**/xrun.log
!Final/**/xrun.history
!Final/**/pnr_icc2/
!Final/**/syn/out/
# Nothing confidential may enter the tree even by accident: database and library formats are ignored under Final/ wherever they are.
Final/**/*.dlib
Final/**/*.ndm
Final/**/*.db
Final/**/*.lib
# GDS files contain the foundry standard-cell and I/O library polygons (pv.tcl: write_gds -merge_files): never in the PUBLIC repository.
Final/**/*.gds
Final/**/*.gds.gz
Deliverables/**/*.gds
Deliverables/**/*.gds.gz
# The DEF is written with -include_tech_via_definitions (technology data in its VIAS section): not in the public repository.
Final/**/*.def
Final/**/*.def.gz
